---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Quick Chan | Procurement & Supply Chain Professional">

<main>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero about-hero">
    <div class="container">

      <h1>
        About Quick Chan.<br />
        Procurement Expertise.<br />
        Manufacturing Knowledge.<br />
        Supply Chain Solutions.
      </h1>

      <p>
       I'm Quick Chan, an MCIPS qualified procurement professional with 15+ years 
       of experience in international trade, procurement and supply chain management.

       I help global businesses build reliable supply chains through supplier 
       evaluation, manufacturing knowledge and strategic sourcing across Mainland China,
       Taiwan and Vietnam.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- About Quick Chan -->
  <section class="section">

    <div class="container">

      <h2 class="section-title">
        About Quick Chan
      </h2>


      <div class="content">

      <p>
      Quick Chan is a procurement and supply chain professional with over 15 years of experience in international trade and more than 7 years specialising in procurement and supply chain management.
      Unlike traditional sourcing services focused only on supplier matching,Quick combines procurement methodology with practical manufacturing experience to help businesses make better sourcing decisions.
      </p>

      <p>
      With an MCIPS qualification background, Quick applies structured procurement methodologies to supplier evaluation, purchasing decisions, cost optimisation and supply chain risk management.
      </p>

      <p>
      Working with manufacturing networks across Mainland China, Taiwan and Vietnam, Quick works with global businesses to develop reliable supplier relationships and support purchasing decisions across Mainland China, Taiwan and the wider Asian manufacturing landscape.
      </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>



  <!-- Procurement Approach -->
  <section class="section light">

    <div class="container">

      <h2 class="section-title">
        A Procurement-Led Approach
      </h2>


      <p class="section-intro">
        Successful supply chains require more than finding suppliers.
        They require a structured procurement approach that balances cost,
        quality, capability and long-term reliability.
      </p>


        <div class="approach-grid">

        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Supplier Evaluation
          </h3>

          <p>
            Assess supplier capability, production capacity, quality standards
            and suitability before establishing long-term partnerships.
          </p>

        </div>



        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Purchasing Strategy
          </h3>

          <p>
            Support better purchasing decisions through market analysis,
            supplier comparison, negotiation and total cost consideration.
          </p>

        </div>



        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Supply Chain Risk Management
          </h3>

          <p>
            Identify potential supply chain risks and develop practical
            solutions to improve resilience and continuity.
          </p>

        </div>



        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Supplier Relationship Management
          </h3>

          <p>
            Build effective communication between buyers and manufacturing
            partners to support sustainable cooperation.
          </p>

        </div>


      </div>


    </div>

  </section>




  <!-- Professional Background -->
  <section class="section background-section">

    <div class="container">

      <h2 class="section-title">
        Professional Background
      </h2>


      <div class="card-grid">


        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            15+ Years
          </h3>

          <p>
            International trade experience supporting global business operations.
          </p>

        </div>



        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            7+ Years
          </h3>

          <p>
            Procurement and supply chain management experience.
          </p>

        </div>



        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            MCIPS Qualified
          </h3>

          <p>
            Professional procurement knowledge based on internationally
            recognised procurement principles.
          </p>

        </div>


      </div>


    </div>

  </section>




  <!-- Why HYWSource -->
<section class="section">

  <div class="container">

    <h2 class="section-title">
      Why Businesses Work With HYWSource
    </h2>


    <div class="card-grid">


<div class="card">

<h3>
Procurement Perspective
</h3>

<p>
Procurement decisions based on cost, quality, supplier capability and long-term business objectives — not simply price.
</p>

</div>



<div class="card">

<h3>
Manufacturing Understanding
</h3>

<p>
Practical understanding of Asian manufacturing capabilities, production processes, materials and supplier evaluation.
</p>

</div>



<div class="card">

<h3>
Global Buyer Experience
</h3>

<p>
Experience supporting international buyers with supplier development, purchasing coordination and supply chain management.
</p>

</div>


</div>


  </div>

</section>




  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section">

    <div class="container">

      <div class="dark-section">


        <h2>
          Building a Reliable Supply Chain in Asia?
        </h2>


        <p>
          Let's discuss how HYWSource can support your purchasing decisions,
          supplier development and supply chain management across Mainland China, Taiwan and Vietnam.
        </p>


        <a href="/contact" class="btn-white">
          Discuss Your Supply Chain Requirements
        </a>


      </div>


    </div>


  </section>


</main>

</Layout>